  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "### Changed\n\n- [Update FSharp.Compiler.Service to 43.13.404, FSharp.Core to 10.1.404, and Ionide.ProjInfo.ProjectSystem to 0.76.0](https://github.com/ionide/FSharp.Analyzers.SDK/pull/365). FCS 43.13 adds record type and expression spreads (`{ ...a; B = 1 }`) to the syntax tree. `SynExpr.Record` now holds `SynExprRecordFieldOrSpread` values, and `SynTypeDefnSimpleRepr.Record` holds `SynFieldOrSpread` values. Analyzers that match on these nodes must be rebuilt against 0.43.0.\n\n### Added\n\n- [`ASTCollecting.walkAst` visits the expression of a record expression spread and the type of a record type spread](https://github.com/ionide/FSharp.Analyzers.SDK/pull/365).",
